# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for `pnpm proxy`.
# Optional: without a key the proxy uses CoinGecko's keyless public tier,
# which has a lower, shared rate limit. Get a free Demo key at
# https://www.coingecko.com/en/api/pricing
# Deployed Workers read it from a secret instead: `wrangler secret put COINGECKO_API_KEY`.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=
